	(descr "TI VQFN-HR-11 'VAH' package (VAH0011B), 2.2x3.6 mm, 0.55 mm pitch, wettable flank: TPS1HC08-Q1 (SLVSI27) and the TPS2HC08/TPS2HC16-Q1 family. Copper is TI land pattern 4230593/B (SLVSI27 p.68) traced from TI's vector drawing; paste is TI's example stencil (p.69): VBB printed as a 1.71x0.81 mm window plus four 0.245x0.3 mm end tabs. TI's land pattern puts three 0.2 mm vias in VBB (pin 2) on its centre line at x = -0.7, 0, +0.7 mm, y = -0.449 mm: add filled vias there in the layout. TI asks for non-solder-mask-defined lands, mask opening at most 0.05 mm beyond the copper.")
